      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Midway City Feed Store opened in 1942, supplying horse owners and selling rabbits, guinea pigs, chicks, ducklings, and goslings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
